 <p class="text-center text-slate-500 text-sm max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">Choose Qi2 for cross-platform magnetic charging, MagSafe for Apple-only accessories, and original Qi only for legacy non-magnetic products. Qi2 gives you MagSafe-compatible alignment without Apple MFi licensing.</p>

