<!-- Why Wireless/Magnetic -->
<section id="why-wireless-magnetic" class="sec bg-white relative" data-section="content">
 <div class="container-wide">
 <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-black text-brandBlue uppercase italic tracking-tighter mb-4 text-center">Why Choose <span class="text-brandOrange">Wireless / Magnetic</span> for Your Brand</h2>
 <p class="text-center text-slate-500 text-sm max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">Choose wireless magnetic power banks for premium retail positioning, iPhone and Android compatibility, and cable-free convenience at higher ASPs.</p>
 <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
 <div class="card-soft p-6 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-black text-brandBlue uppercase mb-3 text-sm">iPhone Ecosystem Capture</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">800M+ MagSafe-compatible iPhones in market (12-16 series). Qi2 power banks tap directly into Apple's premium user base.</p></div>
 <div class="card-soft p-6 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-black text-brandBlue uppercase mb-3 text-sm">Premium Shelf Appeal</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Slim magnetic design photographs well, sells at $39-89 retail. Higher margins than commodity cable power banks.</p></div>
 <div class="card-soft p-6 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-black text-brandBlue uppercase mb-3 text-sm">Cable-Free Convenience</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Snap and charge. No more lost cables, no port wear. Particularly attractive for travel and corporate gift markets.</p></div>
 <div class="card-soft p-6 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-black text-brandBlue uppercase mb-3 text-sm">Qi2 Certification</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">WPC-certified products carry the Qi2 logo, a strong trust signal at retail. Avoid "Qi compatible" marketing traps.</p></div>
 <div class="card-soft p-6 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-black text-brandBlue uppercase mb-3 text-sm">MagSafe Case Compatibility</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Works with most MagSafe-compatible cases. Magnetic alignment penetrates standard 4mm cases without speed loss.</p></div>
 <div class="card-soft p-6 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-black text-brandBlue uppercase mb-3 text-sm">Repeat Purchase Driver</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Customers often buy 2-3 units (one per bag, desk, car). Better lifetime customer value than single-purchase categories.</p></div>
 </div>
 </div>
</section>
