 <p class="text-center text-slate-500 text-sm max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">Magnetic wireless power banks were iPhone-only until 2025. Now Samsung Galaxy S25 and Google Pixel 10 support Qi2 natively — and more Android flagships are joining in 2026 H2. Your Qi2 power bank inventory just became cross-platform.</p>

